                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "Veterans here in the Valley and across our nation have sacrificed and fearlessly defended our country \u2014 something we will always be grateful for. Ensuring they receive the benefits, healthcare, and support they've earned is essential. \n \nThat\u2019s why I met with leaders from the veteran's community throughout Tulare County, to provide a legislative update and show how I\u2019m fighting for them in D.C.",
