                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "\ud83d\udea8HAPPENING TOMORROW: my \u201cFighting for Affordable Care\u201d Telephone Town Hall.  \n\nRepublicans are refusing to come to the table to extend critical ACA tax credits - forcing Valley families and Americans across the country to have higher healthcare costs. \n\nJoin me to hear how I\u2019m fighting for you, get updates on the government shutdown, and ask your questions about affordable health care.",
