                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "22,000 people in my district will face skyrocketing healthcare costs if the Affordable Care Act (ACA) premium tax credits are not extended. This would force hardworking families to choose between healthcare and other basic needs. \n\nWhy is why I\u2019ve signed onto a letter to call on Speaker Mike Johnson to hold a vote on extending the ACA tax credits.",
