                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The ACA premium tax credits are on the line, and we must reach a bipartisan solution \u2013 this cannot wait. \u00a0\n\u00a0\nIf these credits expire, 22,000 people in my district will be hit with skyrocketing healthcare costs, and families are already getting notices. \u00a0\n\u00a0\nAnd with the so-called \u201cBig, Beautiful Bill\u201d already gutting Medicaid, our communities are feeling the consequences. This is unacceptable.",
