                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Our nation\u2019s healthcare system is facing real uncertainty \u2013 from the ACA premiums set to expire for Valley families to a growing nursing shortage.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nMy Expanding Medical Education Act would help build a medical school in the Valley and strengthen our healthcare workforce. \u00a0\n\u00a0\nOur Valley deserves affordable care, more providers, and real opportunities.",
